    "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
    "intro": "Short answers to help you choose well and get off to a good start.",
    "substrate_question": "Which substrate is right for my plant?",
    "substrate_answer": "Tropical aroids usually need a particularly airy, free-draining mix. Herbs and seedlings benefit from finer mixes with even moisture. Use the substrate configurator when unsure.",
    "application_question": "How should I use substrate additives?",
